        "text": "=You are an expert LinkedIn content editor.\n\nReview the following LinkedIn post:\n\n{{ $json.output }}\n\nReview criteria:\n1. Hook: Score the opening line out of 10 for attention and engagement.\n2. Clarity: Score the post out of 10 for readability and usefulness.\n3. Call to Action: Score the CTA out of 10 for relevance and engagement.\n\nInstructions:\n- Identify the weakest area based on these scores.\n- Rewrite and improve the weakest part.\n- Preserve the original topic and meaning.\n- Keep the final post between 120 and 150 words.\n- Maintain a professional, conversational tone.\n- Include exactly one clear call to action.\n- Use no more than 3 relevant hashtags.\n- Return ONLY the final improved LinkedIn post.\n- Do not include scores, feedback, explanations, or headings.",
        "options": {}
